Package: flickos-kit-python
Architecture: all
Depends: flickos-kit-base,
         python3-venv,
         python3-dev,
         python3-pip,
         pipx,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: FlickOS developer kit: Python development: venv, pip and pipx
 What a Python project needs: virtual environments, the headers to
 build extensions, pip and pipx. As Debian intends, pip installs into a
 virtual environment, not into the system.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Developer Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md).
